sequenceDiagram
    participant A as SAMAR API
    participant T as Microsoft identity
    participant B as Business Central
    participant S as SAMAR document store

    Note over A,B: Raising the documents
    A->>T: requests access token
    T-->>A: returns token
    A->>B: posts invoice request
    B-->>A: acknowledges

    Note over A,B: Hourly read back
    A->>B: asks for document results
    B-->>A: returns document numbers

    Note over B,S: Returning the files
    B->>A: signs in as the ERP account
    B->>A: uploads invoice and receipt files
    A->>S: stores files against the payment
    A-->>B: confirms receipt
